	(text "Safety signals stay OFF this board (P1):\nHWTO1+ / HWTO2+ (-KE2 Q1 / Q2), EDM- (I3 / I4),\nE-stop X1/X2/I1/I2, OSSD I5/I6, I7, I8.\nThey keep their terminals until function D.\nEDM+ and HWTO- here are supplies, not signals."
