	(text "H2, H3, H5, H6: M4 standoffs = CHASSIS. H1, H4 (48 V zone): unplated. Board max 150 x 250 mm (owner)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 413.0 364.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f09261b7-ed85-51a8-b9cf-70722897060f")
	)
	(text "NOTES  1) Fuses: Littelfuse MINI 58 V (0997xxx.WXN), 1000 A @ 58 V DC; -QA1 is the backup above that (P7). One fuse type on the whole board.  2) LED on = branch powered; dark = fuse blown or no supply.  3) Currents and fuse values are estimates: confirm by clamp-meter round (study section 8)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.0 402.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "828b9ea7-f7d9-54a5-9fc1-bae06d95ca11")
	)
	(text "4) The 24 V converter is SD-100C-24 (owner 2026-11-16); documents still say SD-150C-24.  5) Parts from LCSC for full JLCPCB assembly: Kefa KF2EDGVM 7.62 (48 V), Degson 2EDGVM 5.08 (inputs, IPC), Kefa KF2EDGVM 3.5 (signals, small loads), flanged; fuse holder XFCN XF-508P-B-B. Plugs and fuses are loose parts (field Loose part)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.0 406.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
